                     				                                  Marathon Open Source Saved Game Editor                                                                                          Version 1.2.5																																																																																							 				For CarbonBy Craig Miller <jedric@geocities.com>Web Page: <www.geocities.com/jeddhs>What is MOSSGE?MOSSGE is a saved game editor for Marathon 2 and Marathon Infinity. It allows the user to quickly add more weapons and amunition to their saved game.MOSSGE is open source. The source code is available from the web address at the top of this document.If you wish to add to this application then please email me any changes that you make and I will include them in the main source.RequirementsPPC processor (you can compile it for 68K if you wish)Mac OS 8.1 or above or Mac OS X DP3 or later (may work on DP2 or earlier)Navigation ServicesCarbonLibVersion HistoryVersion 1.2.5 (05/29/2000)¥ Now a 'proper' Carbon app (works on Mac OS X!)¥ New Navigation Services code¥ Interface fixed for AquaVersion 1.2.1 (05/13/2000)¥ Updated for Carbon¥ More error checkingVersion 1.2 (04/25/2000)¥ Marathon 2 support added¥ Max everything button addedVersion 1.1 (04/23/2000)¥ Shields editor added¥ Oxygen editor addedVersion 1.0 (04/20/2000)¥ Interface fixed up¥ Small code improvements¥ Seperate binary archive from source code archiveVersion 0.8d (04/19/2000)¥ Initial releaseDisclaimerWarning! This software is provided "as is" and has only been tested on an iMac revison B (development machine) running Mac OS 9.0.4. Craig Miller and anyone with anything to do with this software can not be held responsible for any damage this software may do to you, your computer or anything else! If you do not agree to this then delete this software now!